 company2 | 07-03-2023 |  1500 |             |           
 company2 | 07-04-2023 |  1400 |             |           
 company2 | 07-05-2023 |  1500 |             |           
 company2 | 07-06-2023 |    60 |          60 |       1100
 company2 | 07-07-2023 |  1100 |             |           
 company2 | 07-08-2023 |  1300 |             |           
 company2 | 07-09-2023 |  1200 |             |           
 company2 | 07-10-2023 |  1300 |             |           
(20 rows)

